machine.dtpf.machinetype=Plasma Fusion, DTPF
machine.dtpf.tooltip.desc=§7A large fusion controller built from reactor coils and fusion machine casings, running the Large Fusion recipe pool
machine.dtpf.tooltip.flavour=§7Coils and casings must share a tier, or it will just tell you the structure is wrong
machine.dtpf.tooltip.runtime.header=§6Runtime:
machine.dtpf.tooltip.runtime.time=§7· In wired mode, §b3600s§7 of continuous running reaches full efficiency: EU/t and recipe duration each §bhalved§7
machine.dtpf.tooltip.runtime.decay=§7· Below §b3600s§7 there is no EU/duration reduction; while idle the runtime decays by §b100§7 ticks per tick
machine.dtpf.tooltip.runtime.parallel=§7· Wired parallel = §b(1+machine tier-recipe tier)×64§7; recipe tier = recipe voltage tier-5 (min §b1§7), parallel min §b1§7
machine.dtpf.tooltip.wireless.header=§6Wireless Mode:
machine.dtpf.tooltip.wireless.enable=§7· Unlocks with an §bAstral Array§7 in the controller slot and structure tier §eMK-V§7; power is drawn straight from the wireless network
machine.dtpf.tooltip.wireless.cap=§7· Parallel is set in the GUI (§b1..2147483647§7) and capped by the current network balance
machine.dtpf.tooltip.wireless.rate=§7· Fixed §a0.75×§7 EU and duration discount; the §b3600s§7 full-efficiency bonus is disabled
machine.dtpf.tooltip.overclock.header=§6Overclock:
machine.dtpf.tooltip.overclock.tier=§7· Overclock ratio scales with tier: §eMK-I..MK-III§7 §b2/4§7, §eMK-IV§7 §b4/4§7 (lossless), §eMK-V§7 §b4/2§7 (special, total energy halved)
machine.dtpf.tooltip.overclock.special=§7· From §eMK-IV§7 on it is lossless, and §eMK-V§7 adds the special overclock~Nya
machine.dtpf.tooltip.structure.header=§6Structure:
machine.dtpf.tooltip.structure.tiers=§7· A coils and B casings must share a tier: MK-I..MK-V map to §eLuV, ZPM, UV, UHV, UEV§7; §conly recipes up to that voltage§7
machine.dtpf.tooltip.structure.blocks=§7· The A coils are the five §eCompact Fusion Coil§7 blocks (MK-I..MK-V: §bAmeliorated Superconducting Coil / Compact Fusion Coil / Advanced Compact Fusion Coil / Compact Fusion Coil MK-II Prototype / Compact Fusion Coil MK-II Finaltype§7); C is the §eZPM Solenoid Superconductor Coil§7; D is §eAdvanced Iridium Plated Machine Casing§7
machine.dtpf.tooltip.structure.hatch=§7· D compartments need at least §b1§7 input (bus or hatch) and §b1§7 output (bus or hatch); wired mode also needs §b1§7 energy hatch, wireless mode §cforbids energy hatches§7
machine.dtpf.tooltip.details=§dDetails:§7 the structure tier comes from the paired A coils and B casings, which must match exactly
machine.dtpf.tooltip.details.hint=§7· Removing the §bAstral Array§7 from the controller slot turns wireless mode off at once, and structure tier §eMK-V§7 is still required

