machine.spacemoduleassembler.tooltip.power.nooverclock=§7· No overclocking: EU and duration stay at the recipe's base values, with no speed bonus
machine.spacemoduleassembler.tooltip.power.billing=§7· Every recipe cycle charges §brecipe EU/t × parallel × duration§7 to the network
